<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Welcome to Rea</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f5f5f5;
      }

      .email-wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 20px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      .container {
        width: 90%;
        max-width: 600px;
        color: #5c5c5c;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
      }

      .header {
        height: 144px;
        background-color: #7d52f41a;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        position: relative;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .logo {
        width: 70px;
        height: 44px;
        margin: 20px;
        display: block;
      }

      .ellipse-one {
        width: 230px;
        height: 50px;
        position: absolute;
        right: 0;
        bottom: 0;
      }

      .ellipse-two {
        width: 111px;
        height: 60px;
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
      }

      .ellipse-three {
        width: 170px;
        height: 60px;
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        right: 50px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 20px;
        color: #333333;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .greeting {
        font-size: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        color: #333333;
      }

      .main-text {
        font-size: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        color: #333333;
      }

      .highlight-box {
        background-color: #7d52f41a;
        border-left: 4px solid #7d52f4;
        color: #7d52f4;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 24px 0;
      }

      .highlight-text {
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #6b4de6;
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .body-text {
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #555555;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .signature {
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #333333;
        margin-top: 24px;
      }

      .signature p {
        margin: 0;
      }

      .signature p + p {
        margin-top: 4px;
      }

      .footer {
        padding: 30px 40px;
        text-align: center;
        background-color: #f7f7f7;
      }

      .unsubscribe {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #999999;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .link {
        color: #999999;
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      .copyright {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #bbbbbb;
        margin: 0;
      }

      /* Responsive design */
      @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
        .container {
          width: 100%;
        }

        .ellipse-one,
        .ellipse-two,
        .ellipse-three {
          display: none;
        }

        .content {
          padding: 15px;
        }

        .footer {
          padding: 20px 15px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
      <table
        width="100%"
        cellpadding="0"
        cellspacing="0"
        style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto"
      >
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>
              <div class="container">
                <!-- HEADER -->
                <div class="header">
                  <img src="cid:logo" alt="Rea Logo" width="70" height="44" class="logo" />
                  <img src="cid:ellipse-one" class="ellipse-one" alt="" width="201" height="51" />
                  <img src="cid:ellipse-two" class="ellipse-two" alt="" width="56" height="56" />
                  <img src="cid:ellipse-three" class="ellipse-three" alt="" width="56" height="56" />
                </div>

                <!-- CONTENT -->
                <div class="content">
                  <p class="greeting">Hi {{ name }},</p>
                  <p class="main-text">
                    Thank you for joining the waitlist for Rea.
                  </p>

                  <div class="highlight-box">
                    <p class="highlight-text">
                      We're exploring a simple idea:<br />
                      What if the Bible could talk back?
                    </p>
                  </div>

                  <p class="body-text">
                    Rea is being built to help you reflect, ask questions, and
                    grow closer to God through gentle, Scripture-filled
                    conversations. We'll keep you updated as we get closer to
                    launch, and you'll be among the first to experience it.
                  </p>

                  <p class="body-text">
                    Thank you for being part of this journey with us.<br />
                    We can't wait to share more with you soon.
                  </p>

                  <div class="signature">
                    <p>With gratitude,</p>
                    <p>The Rea Team.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FOOTER -->
                <div class="footer">
                  <p class="unsubscribe">
                    If you ever wish to step off this journey, you can
                    <a href="{{ unsubscribeUrl }}" class="link">unsubscribe</a>
                    anytime.
                  </p>
                  <p class="copyright">© {{ copyRightYear }} Rea</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
